      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "jlIBB97pY0cLNe-M9_FXg",
        "revealOrder": 1
      },
      "text": "in that more than ninety percent of its material is unique. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in that more than ninety percent of its material is unique. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TCQA8uDFzA-HqdJGqvUXz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2979.630411376254,
      "y": 33314.45650712951,
      "width": 380.6557312011719,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "m_BPlKJLExNAJ5JW9AoPm",
      "index": "b9I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1228092235,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 679063403,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773545499513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "tymTzUxa-ZKJ0ZPVSkh1i",
        "revealOrder": 2
      },
      "text": "John's Gospel does not focus on the miracles, \nparables, and public speeches that are so prominent \nin the other accounts. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "John's Gospel does not focus on the miracles, \nparables, and public speeches that are so prominent \nin the other accounts. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZU3Scd5S0HXUnOPH9DgzK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2979.630411376254,
      "y": 33426.38449549103,
      "width": 423.11962890625,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "m_BPlKJLExNAJ5JW9AoPm",
      "index": "b9J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1923387883,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 2026606789,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773545499513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "name": "Xk_PAKc2Gfurh7T5SPpRB",
        "revealOrder": 3
      },
      "text": "Instead, the Gospel of John\nemphasizes the identity of Jesus as the Son of God \nand how we, as believers, should respond to his teachings.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead, the Gospel of John\nemphasizes the identity of Jesus as the Son of God \nand how we, as believers, should respond to his teachings.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
